<title>UK: Israel's Technoplast shares oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Israel's Technoplast shares oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli plastics company Technoplast Industries Ltd said on Thursday a share issue to raise a total of about 12 million stg had been oversubscribed by some 40 percent. The company raised proceeds of 10 million stg, or 8.8 million stg net, through the issue of 8.0 million new ordinary shares at 125p each, Technoplast said. Managing director Itamar Patishi also planned to sell 1.6 million ordinary shares he controlled.</p>
<p>Dealing in Technoplast's shares was expected to begin on Monday in London.</p>
<p>The placing was made by Henderson Crosthwaite and underwritten by Guinness Mahon.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
